nditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>MAG_BLOODFEEDER_SCARLET_TRANCE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Scarlet_Saturation\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Saturation_(Condition)\" title=\"Scarlet Saturation (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Scarlet_Saturation_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Scarlet_Saturation_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Scarlet_Saturation_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Scarlet_Saturation_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Scarlet_Saturation_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Scarlet_Saturation_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scarlet Saturation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Scarlet_Saturation_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Scarlet_Saturation_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Scarlet_Saturation_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Scarlet Saturation</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Your next attack is guaranteed to <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critically Hit</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Scarlet_Stupor\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Stupor_(Condition)\" title=\"Scarlet Stupor (Condition)\"><picture><so